ersisted locally and driven through mock React + approval dry-run; all 24 supported m365 business fact kinds are available; business core/raw local shards are ready; doctor reports local readiness and missing kotoba/model config; completion-audit proves local facts/store/shards/local gates and isolates the remaining live requirements; local-react-gate now re-reads store checkpoints, executed effects, and pending approvals as proof that OpenClaw/XRPC/approval dry-run already executed; business-local-gate re-reads all-business shard coverage and the business-core XRPC real-operate store, proving local all-business coverage before live writes; production-preflight returns business-wide kotoba import and real React commands; completion-audit requires separate core and all live evidence scopes, rejects core evidence reused as all-business proof, and requires operate-live evidence format plus completed status and facts-dir/graph/thread identity; operate-live now persists failed partial evidence with failed-phase/error for restart diagnosis but never treats it as complete, live-evidence returns recover-live-failure plus rerun/import next actions, resume-live can reuse saved company phase before rerunning business, and runbook-live calls resume-live after failed core/all operate-live attempts; operate-company bundles import, OpenClaw smoke, kotoba XRPC smoke, and readiness; operate-store bundles OpenClaw smoke, kotoba XRPC store smoke, approval dry-run, and readiness for release gating; runbook-company emits an executable bash runbook for offline and real-credential paths; kotoba import-company, streaming import-business-core/raw, kotoba XRPC smoke, kotoba real-react-company, kotoba operate-real-company, kotoba operate-real-business, and runtime preflight are implemented; OpenAI-compatible openclaw/hermes smoke verifies the real-model tool-calling path without external credentials, including the kotoba XRPC real-model and approval dry-run boundary over company and business-core snapshots; real kotoba/Hermes/OpenClaw service verification still requires KOTOBA_URL/KOTOBA_GRAPH and model endpoint credentials.\", :company_runtime_approval_verified_2026_06_27 {:runtime_command \"clojure -M:runtime mock-react /tmp/cloud-itonami-company.edn 'gftdcojp と gftdjapan株式会社の手続き・社員対応を確認し、必要な承認へ進めて' gftd-company-thread\", :approval_commands [\"clojure -M:approval list /tmp/cloud-itonami-company.edn\" \"clojure -M:approval approve /tmp/cloud-itonami-company.edn <effect-id> jun 'company bootstrap approval'\" \"clojure -M:approval execute-dry-run /tmp/cloud-itonami-company.edn\"], :thread-id \"gftd-company-thread\", :effect-kind :procedure.review, :final-db {:activities 10938, :actors 5511, :artifacts 219, :effects 10939, :checkpoints 5, :decisions 1, :audits 2, :datoms 176770}}, :expanded_billing_contract_verified_2026_06_27 {:unit [\"cloud-itonami.m365-test\" \"cloud-itonami.facts-test\"], :report_command \"clojure -M:ingest report ../m365-archive/facts contract-att-terms billing-att-terms finance-terms current-billing invoice-amounts-recovered financials-annual financials-by-period financials-reconciliation trial-balance chart-of-accounts\", :kinds [:contract-att-terms :billing-att-terms :finance-terms :current-billing :invoice-amounts-recovered :financials-annual :financials-by-period :financials-reconciliation :trial-balance :chart-of-accounts], :smoke {:facts [:procedure-terms :finance-terms :current-billing], :db {:activities 3, :artifacts 2, :effects 4, :checkpoints 5, :decisions 1, :audits 2}}, :unavailable_annex_2026_06_27 {:current-billing \"git -C ../m365-archive annex get facts/current-billing.edn\", :finance-terms \"git -C ../m365-archive annex get facts/finance-terms.edn\", :contract-att-terms \"git -C ../m365-archive annex get facts/contract-att-terms.edn\", :billing-att-terms \"git -C ../m365-archive annex get facts/billing-att-terms.edn\", :chart-of-accounts \"git -C ../m365-archive annex get facts/chart-of-accounts.edn\", :financials-r